BiliNote-custom

This repository is a modified distribution of BiliNote:
https://github.com/JefferyHcool/BiliNote

The upstream project is licensed under the MIT License. This repository keeps
the MIT License and preserves the original copyright notice in LICENSE.

Local modifications include Bilibili cookie refresh handling, resumable and
streaming note-generation previews, frontend partial-markdown rendering during
summarization, and additional deployment configuration examples.
